---
description: LitMotion-only code animation rule for Gem TD
globs: Assets/Scripts/**/*.cs
alwaysApply: false
---

# Code animation

- Value changes over time in C# use LitMotion.
- Do not tween with a coroutine, `Update`, `LateUpdate`, or DOTween.
- Keep animation in presentation code. Do not use animation timing to implement
  combat, economy, wave, save, or damage rules.
- Cancel or complete an existing motion before starting a replacement when the
  view can be refreshed or disabled.
